sequenceDiagram
    participant Bot as EmployeeBot
    participant H as Use-case Handler
    participant C as IEmployeeDataClient
    participant API as Employee Data API

    Bot->>H: HandleAsync(request, callerEmployeeNumber)
    Note over H: employee number is clamped to the caller
    H->>C: GetEmployeeAsync / GetManagerTeamAsync / motivation op
    C->>API: GET/POST/DELETE (CA gateway, internal)
    alt success (200)
        API-->>C: JSON payload
        C-->>H: mapped DTOs
        H-->>Bot: response value object
    else error / timeout (5xx, network)
        API-->>C: error
        C-->>H: throws / failure
        H-->>Bot: failure -> "service unreachable" (BR-09)
    end
